  "rationale": "The one home (SPEC_STANDARD 15.4) of every policy value Registry's generated code reads that is neither an environment setting (runtime_settings) nor an enumeration member or field type (models): typed constants of the data_provider module (State 3), which a consumer imports by name as the State 5 table 'Constants each module imports' lists (SPEC_STANDARD 6.10, 15.3.1, 15.9). Decided values are carried unchanged from the decisions in source_refs: A13's durations and refusal count, A18's 03:00, look and 30 x 24 hours, A19's 50 MB, A01's 128, A02's 40 (R0-90) and the characteristics' bounds, A17's 32 bytes, A09's rights and highest classes (rows in the enumeration values State 6 declares), A22's one type estimate by PresuPro. Technical values chosen by the author under the owner's delegation of 2026-11-11: the backup prefixes registry-backup- and registry-tmp- (neither begins with the other), the store's temporary suffix .new, STORE_VERSION 1 (the first store of re-authored Registry; the v1 store is not opened, the import reads a file), RELEASE_VERSION registry-2.0.0 and CONTRACT_VERSION registry-contract-2 (v1 being the first). OBJECT_FLOOR_AREA_MIN_EXCLUSIVE is a fixed-precision decimal written as a string (SPEC_STANDARD 15.4). A17's port bounds 1 and 65535 are LISTEN_PORT_MIN and LISTEN_PORT_MAX.",
